  "uiSpec.icons.decision": "Source & decision",
  "uiSpec.icons.decision.auxiliary.body": "Keep volume, mute, fullscreen, captions and settings outlined. They may coexist with Filled transport controls when size, weight and color hierarchy are coordinated.",
  "uiSpec.icons.decision.auxiliary.title": "Auxiliary actions → Outline",
  "uiSpec.icons.decision.special.body": "Reuse existing solid menu dots and the media-cover Skill glyph. Brands, multicolor artwork and illustrations keep their own semantics.",
  "uiSpec.icons.decision.special.title": "Small glyphs & special assets",
  "uiSpec.icons.decision.state.body": "Specify Filled states for favorites and pins individually. A connector paused status is not a media pause action.",
